  &=(1-1)\ket{ud}=0,\nonumber\\
  (\sigma_3+\tau_3)\ket{du}
  &=(-1+1)\ket{du}=0.\end{aligned}$ Следовательно, $(\sigma_3+\tau_3)\ket{\psi_\pm}=0.$ Для обоих выборов знака полная третья компонента в каждом отдельном опыте равна нулю.

p.src:
The first component separates them. From Equation [eq:l05-pauli-actions], $\begin{aligned}(\sigma_1+\tau_1)\ket{ud}
  &=\ket{dd}+\ket{uu},\nonumber\\
  (\sigma_1+\tau_1)\ket{du}
  &=\ket{uu}+\ket{dd}.\end{aligned}$ Thus $\begin{aligned}(\sigma_1+\tau_1)\ket{\psi_+}
  &=
  \sqrt2\bigl(\ket{uu}+\ket{dd}\bigr),\nonumber\\
  (\sigma_1+\tau_1)\ket{\psi_-}
  &=0.
  \end{aligned}$ The plus state may have zero expectation value for this observable, but it is not its zero-eigenvalue eigenstate.

